{
  "declaredLength": 8564,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. How fortunate to\nfind<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nyou<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhere<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nat<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthis<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nparticular<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmoment.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 21,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m here for a business meeting with one of our\nregular associates. Stay and observe if you like.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Our apologies for the wait.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750072002000610070006F006C006F006700690065007300200066006F0072002000740068006500200077006100690074002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Since this meeting is already running somewhat\nbehind schedule, we’ll get right to the point.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ve had a look at our financials, and we must\nsay—it feels to us that Quasartico isn’t paying<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntheir fair share for our hyperspace survey work.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 152
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I see. However, this is the split we agreed upon at\nthe outset. And Quasartico Inc. has provided a fair<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndeal of material support as well as financial.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 158
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We have also paid for R&D of additional tools that\nhave aided this whole endeavor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We do acknowledge and appreciate that support,\nof course.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut at the same time, the number of distortions\nwe had to investigate exceeded all estimates.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThis undertaking has required far more manpower\nthan we budgeted for.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 232
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hard work tires people out. And what better way\nto show appreciation than a little cash bonus?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Noted. However, any changes to the budget\nwould require buy-in from all our stakeholders.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nIt’s not something I can make happen right away.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perfectly understandable for such a major\ncompany tasked with the city’s redevelopment.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Though we do wish to point out that our\ninvestigations were also critical to ensure that<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nyou still HAD a city to redevelop.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now, I understand we all want what’s best for\nLumiose City, but talking’s getting us nowhere.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 3224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perhaps we should settle this little disagreement\nwith a Pokémon battle?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 3420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>\nI have no objection.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHowever, allow me to nominate my associate\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhere<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nto<U+0010><U+0001>븀\njoin<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nme.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 19,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s do this",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200064006F002000740068006900730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why me?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800790020006D0065003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please accept. It wouldn’t be wise to make\nCorbeau wait. Displeasing partners isn’t good for<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbusiness.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I admit that my own pride is also a small factor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 4064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000610064006D00690074002000740068006100740020006D00790020006F0077006E00200070007200690064006500200069007300200061006C0073006F0020006100200073006D0061006C006C00200066006100630074006F0072002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 4172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Looks like we’re just gonna have to get our due\nout of Vinnie through battle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 4184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll be doing everything in my power to defeat you\nboth. The boss’s reputation is on the line.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 4348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s do this!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200064006F0020007400680069007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Give me a sec",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470069007600650020006D00650020006100200073006500630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh come on—let’s hurry up and battle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006800200063006F006D00650020006F006E2014006C006500742019007300200068007500720072007900200075007000200061006E006400200062006100740074006C0065002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kind words are nice and all, but they’re not what\nreally motivates people in the end!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The Rust Syndicate has our pride. We won’t make\nour people work for nothing.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The boss’s reputation is on the line, so don’t\nexpect me to hold back!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 5036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We should get this battle started as soon as\npossible and not keep Corbeau waiting.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 5188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 5364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Scolipede! As long as you’re with me, I can face\nany pinch with a smile!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 5376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mega Evolution proves our bond. Let me show\nyou the true beauty of Skarmory!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 5532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Drampa, our hearts are perfectly aligned! Let us\nshow them what Mega Evolution can really do!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That was a worthy battle. I doubt I could have won\nwithout <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061007400200077006100730020006100200077006F007200740068007900200062006100740074006C0065002E0020004900200064006F0075006200740020004900200063006F0075006C00640020006800610076006500200077006F006E000A0077006900740068006F0075007400200010000201000000002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But a loss is a loss. We’ll let the matter of costs\nlie for the moment.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 6044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I will do my part to help the syndicate’s finances\nby tightening my belt, so to speak, and reducing<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npersonal costs.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 6196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And please rest assured that I will work with our\nstakeholders to iron out a new budget proposal.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAfter all, we are counting on the Rust Syndicate\nto carry out these investigations for us.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 6444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 196
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Guess I’ll dip into my personal savings a bit to\nmake up for the shortfall on our side.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 6836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>You deserve a special bonus as well,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 7020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000059006F007500200064006500730065007200760065002000610020007300700065006300690061006C00200062006F006E00750073002000610073002000770065006C006C002C000A0010000201000000002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received additional color options for\nCorbeau’s Suit & Tie Set!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 7124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007200650063006500690076006500640020006100640064006900740069006F006E0061006C00200063006F006C006F00720020006F007000740069006F006E007300200066006F0072000A0043006F007200620065006100752019007300200053007500690074002000260020005400690065002000530065007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I hear you can even get your hair done like mine\nat the salon these days. Go nuts, kid.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 7260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vinnie, my friend, I hope we can both continue to\ndo our best to make Lumiose a fine city–the kind<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncrowds visit and spend money in.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 7444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I couldn’t agree more.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThat is why we at Quasartico Inc. all hope to\nnurture our collaboration with the Rust Syndicate.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 7724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This city might’ve changed over time, but it’s still\nwhere I’ve chosen to live. I’ll always love it here.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 7980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We were just little punks, but this city still gave us\na place to call home. I’ll do anything to repay that.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 8200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Corbeau certainly has his own convictions—just\nas I have mine.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 8428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F007200620065006100750020006300650072007400610069006E006C0079002000680061007300200068006900730020006F0077006E00200063006F006E00760069006300740069006F006E00732014006A007500730074000A0061007300200049002000680061007600650020006D0069006E0065002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    }
  ],
